<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Premark Int'l upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Premark Int'l upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- McDonald &amp; Co Securities said Monday it upgraded its rating for Premark International Inc to aggressive buy from hold based on a revised earnings estimates and an 18-month price target of $28.</p>
<p>-- McDonald also raised its earnings estimate for 1997 to $1.70 from $1.65 and set an estimate for 1998 earnings of $1.90.</p>
<p>-- Premark, whose business units include food equipment, decorative products and consumer products, is trading at a 15 to 20 percent discount to its peers on an earnings basis, McDonald said.</p>
<p>-- Premark shares were off 1/2 Monday at 20-3/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
